Package: debtainium
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Debtainium Developers <maintainers@debtainium.org>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Usman0220/debtainium
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec | policykit-1, libnotify-bin, apt
Description: GitHub Release .deb package installer and updater
 Debtainium tracks third-party software distributed as Debian packages
 (.deb) on GitHub Releases, automatically checks for updates, downloads
 and verifies assets, and safely installs them using polkit and apt.
 .
 It provides both a modern GTK4/Libadwaita graphical interface and a
 complete command-line interface, along with a systemd user timer for
 background update notifications.
